      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i was thinking of going with a 14ft span to keep the ceiling height up in the main room, but i'm a bit worried about any natural defects in the timber. since it's a heavy beam, what kind of knots or grain issues should i specifically be looking for that might mess with the structural integrity or the load bearing capacity?",
